1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 740 Tm (Unique completion, the lift, and the embeddability gap) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 725 Tm (Draft. Not a deposited preprint. Lean: lean/Full.lean) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 710 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 695 Tm (Abstract. A process function has one fixed point for every local intervention.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 680 Tm (Checked: distinct outputs leave a party who disagrees in the output and agrees in w,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 665 Tm (and the source-and-sink extension is a bijection on bits.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 650 Tm (Written: that witness kills the off-diagonal, so the induced map is unitary.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 635 Tm (Not claimed: a metric, a wormhole Hamiltonian for Lugano, or the Leifer-Pusey no-go.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 620 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 605 Tm (1. The demand) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 590 Tm (Faye, Stanford Encyclopedia, revised 28 October 2025, leaves the paradoxes open.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 575 Tm (Dummett, 1954 and 1964, set the lexical objection aside. A stipulation is not a discovery.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 560 Tm (Black, Analysis 1956, asked what happens to the intervention.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 545 Tm (Lewis, 1976, split the modal and did not select the histories.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 530 Tm (Horwich asked the theory to say what the intervention does.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 515 Tm (Earman said a filter after the dynamics is not a dynamics.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 500 Tm (No fixed point is the grandfather case. Two fixed points is the bootstrap.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 485 Tm (The identity loop fails the clause. The swap fails it. A measure-zero rider cannot be failed.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 470 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 455 Tm (2. Spacetime) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 440 Tm (Godel, 1949, has closed timelike curves. Morris, Thorne, Yurtsever, 1988, convert a wormhole.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 425 Tm (Friedman et al., 1990, state the changed Cauchy problem.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 410 Tm (Echeverria, Klinkhammer, Thorne, 1991, find one continuation, two, or none.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 395 Tm (The billiard has the wrong multiplicity. Hawking's conjecture is a different question.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 380 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 365 Tm (3. Quantum replies) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 350 Tm (Deutsch, 1991, asks for a fixed point of the partial trace. Uniqueness is not a theorem.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 335 Tm (Aaronson and Watrous put the power at PSPACE. Bennett et al. call it an artefact.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 320 Tm (Lloyd et al. replace the fixed point by post-selection. That is a simulation.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 305 Tm (Oreshkov, Costa, Brukner drop global order. The quantum switch does not violate an inequality.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 290 Tm (Lugano does.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 275 Tm  T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 260 Tm (4. Equations) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 245 Tm (\(1\) o = f\(w\(o\)\)) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 230 Tm (\(2\) w\(a,b,c\) = \(not b and c, not c and a, not a and b\)) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 215 Tm (All 64 binary interventions have one solution. The image has four elements out of eight.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 200 Tm (\(3\) U sends \(o, e\) to \(w\(o\)+e, o\)) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 185 Tm (\(4\) the inverse sends \(i, s\) to \(s, i+w\(s\)\)) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 170 Tm (On bits the sum is exclusive or. Lean checked both compositions.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 155 Tm (\(5\) if s differs from s-prime, some party disagrees in the output and agrees in w.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 140 Tm (Otherwise one local function fixes both strings. Lean accepted this as process_disagreement.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 125 Tm (\(6\) delta_k = w_k\(s-prime\) - w_k\(s\)) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 110 Tm (\(7\) the gram entry is the product of row overlaps against that shift.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 95 Tm (\(8\) MM dagger = I. Written, not kernel-checked.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 80 Tm (\(9\) a channel is i_B = w\(o_A\), i_A independent of o_B.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 54 65 Tm (\(9\) embeds as free propagation. \(2\) has no such wiring. The cyclic case stays open.) Tj T* ET
 
